| HTTP metoda | URL path                    | Opis                              |
| ----------- | --------------------------- | --------------------------------- |
| GET         | `/api/Movie/get-all-movies` | Dohvati sve filmove (paginarano)  |
| GET         | `/api/Movie/{id}`           | Dohvati film po ID-u              |
| POST        | `/api/Movie/add-movie`      | Dodaj novi film                   |
| PUT         | `/api/Movie/update-movie`   | Update film                       |
| DELETE      | `/api/Movie/{id}`           | Obriši film po ID-u               |
| GET         | `/api/Movie/details/{id}`   | Detalji filma s dodatnim podacima |
